# Copy to .env.ethereum (read by npm start and npm run donor). Testnet (Ethereum Sepolia) only.
#
# A seed phrase of your own for this computer's Ethereum accounts: the test donors Rob (index 0) and Sam (1), and the
# campaign's receiving address (2). Make a new one with:
#   node -e "console.log(require('ethers').Wallet.createRandom().mnemonic.phrase)"
# Do NOT use the public test phrase here: its Ethereum addresses are emptied by bots as soon as anything arrives.
PC_ETHEREUM_SEED="<your new test seed phrase>"
